// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Phase 4+ (uncomment as they come online):
//   custom weapons:  weaponfull,<gdt_name>
//   custom FX:       fx,zm_abandoned_cyber_city/<fx_name>
//   localized text:  localize,zm_abandoned_cyber_city
//   LUI widgets:     rawfile,ui/uieditor/widgets/<widget>.lua
//
//   MORE PERK WEAPON-VARIANT TWINS (recoil twins above are LIVE). To add the next
//   combos (Gun Slinger fastfire / Speed Cola fastreload / combined), generate them
//   with tools/apply_recoil_overhaul.js, add the weaponfull lines here AND the combo
//   tail to build_available_twins() `built`, then build. Full recipe: docs/30
//   "Adding a weapon-variant effect". Combo names (base + _up per gun):
//     weaponfull,<gun>_acc_fastfire
//     weaponfull,<gun>_acc_fastreload
//     weaponfull,<gun>_acc_recoil70_fastfire
//     weaponfull,<gun>_acc_recoil70_fastfire_fastreload   (full stack)
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
